				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "# BenjaVision Catalyst DevKit\n\nCatalyst DevKit is the command line and development environment for building applications with Catalyst.\n\nThe goal is simple: create a project, run the DevKit, manage deployments, and stay focused on the application instead of the plumbing.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "V4VmtJSYR0yFXEsKl70IPQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Documentation index\n\n### Start here\n\n- {{gtPage:Quick Start|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:Core Commands|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:Project Configuration|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n\n### Working with deployments\n\n- {{gtPage:Deployments|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:DevKit|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:Jadeite for Pharo|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:GemStone|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n\n### Catalyst platform\n\n- {{gtPage:Catalyst Components|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Connect|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Store|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Users|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Groups|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Currency|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Landform|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Architect|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Reflect|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Catalyst Ecosystems|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:Catalyst Plugins|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n\n### Support and reference\n\n- {{gtPage:Troubleshooting|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n- {{gtPage:Reference|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n\n### Notes\n\nThese are useful working notes and older material. They are kept out of the main docs path so the core documentation stays clean.\n\n- {{gtPage:Notes|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:ACF|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Building a Universe|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Ecosystems Development Journal|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Extras|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:GeoNames|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:Music Video MetaData|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n  - {{gtPage:OtherBarry|db=bb9d96c9-9bd1-0d00-a109-c4d10ab7a977}}\n"
			},
			{
