				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Current shape\n\nUse `bvc` for the normal workflow.\n\nThe documentation is organised by what you are trying to do: start a project, configure it, run the DevKit, manage deployments, then explore Catalyst Components when you are ready.\n\nGemStone and GsDevKit details are still documented, but they are background and reference material. The common path should stay boring. Boring tools are good tools.\n"
			}
		]
